{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16202200","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16202200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620220001:1":{"text":"그로웬, 널 만나러 왔어... 작별 인사를 하러 왔다고 해야 하나.","source_cn":"格墨文，我来看看你……也算是送别吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97A784DBE3A96220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620220002:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620220003:1":{"text":"괜찮아? 네가 불만을 가지고 있다는 건 알아. 하지만 난 널 비웃거나 동정하려는 게 아니라...","source_cn":"你还好吗？我知道你心有不满，但我不是想嘲笑你或者是施舍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03A90CB85E71858B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620220004:1":{"text":"쓸데없는 위선은 집어치우고 할 말 있으면 빨리 해.","source_cn":"省掉这些虚伪无用的问候语，有什么话就直说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC392A81C1502694E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620220005:1":{"text":"너는 날 많이 도와줬지만, 네가 도움이 필요할 때 나는 도와주지 못했어... 그래서 친구로서 사과하고 싶어,","source_cn":"你帮过我很多，我却无法在你需要的时候给予你帮助……站在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6203BF59D075EC01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620220006:1":{"text":"네가 내 사과를 받아주는 것까지는 바라지 않아. 하지만 내 마음만은 알아줬으면 해.","source_cn":"这份歉意，我不奢求你会接受，但我希望你能知道我的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E3F310BE808B5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620220007:0":{"text":"...사과? 아무래도 정말 할 말이 없는 모양이네.","source_cn":"……歉意？看来你的确也没什么可说的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF329138B17BC0616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620220008:1":{"text":"그냥 각자 갈 길 가자. 그럼 넌 미안해할 필요도 없고, 난 후회할 필요 없을 테니까.","source_cn":"不如这样吧，我们各走各的路。你没必要感到抱歉，我也不需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6794289FEAE9AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620220009:1":{"text":"너는 정의와 명예를 안고 찬란하게 빛나겠지. 난 죄와 “고난”을 짊어지고, 고개 숙여 운명의 심판을 받겠어.","source_cn":"你带着你的正义、荣誉和奖赏在人前风光无限。而我，背着我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC538052585FF555D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620220010:1":{"text":"그로웬... 네가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 아직도 모르는 거야?","source_cn":"格墨文，你……你难道不明白你到底做了什么样的事情吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8825CBE8A48CAA5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620220011:1":{"text":"흑마법으로 마물이 되고, 교장 선생님을 해치고... 하나부터 열까지 전부 우리가 해선 안 될 짓이었어!","source_cn":"使用黑魔法，魔化，还杀死校长……每一件都是我们不该也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB6640E68FBB4E30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620220012:1":{"text":"그런 말은 질리게 들었어. 다른 할 말이 없다면...","source_cn":"这些话最近我已经听了很多了，如果你没有别的话要说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCB3371C08F87BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620220013:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620220014:1":{"text":"그로웬!","source_cn":"格墨文！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6199F2817BBC818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620220015:1":{"text":"도대체 왜... 왜 그런 짓을 한 거야! 궁정 마법사 자리가 그렇게까지 중요한 거야?!","source_cn":"你到底为什么……为什么要做出这样的事情！宫廷魔法师的职...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF9FFEAA996FDF14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620220016:1":{"text":"왜냐고? 너는 늘 같은 사람에게 뒤처지는